{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Crane: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja38'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 38 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kulāvakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nests </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>8. Bakajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Crane: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nāccantaṁ nikatippañño, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The clever cheat cannot achieve </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nikatyā sukhamedhati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>ultimate happiness by cheating. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ārādheti nikatippañño, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The clever cheat succeeds only </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>bako kakkaṭakāmivā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>in getting what the crane did from the crab. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Bakajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
